<title>USA: Investor holds 5.55 pct Mail-Well stake.</title>
<headline>Investor holds 5.55 pct Mail-Well stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York investor Marvin Schwartz said Wednesday he holds a 5.55 percent stake in Mail-Well Inc, or 659,000 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Schwartz said the stake includes 519,100 common shares bought between June 12 and August 22 with prices ranging from $8.375 to $9.625 per share.</p>
<p>Schwartz bought the stake for investment purposes, according to the filing.</p>
<p>Midmorning Wednesday, shares were up 1/4 at 10.</p>
</text>
